      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RX 检测与增益",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RX 检测与增益",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "el0166",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 872.0,
      "y": 502.74999999999994,
      "width": 496.0,
      "height": 145.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1156697262,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 192921970,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "【LMT Peak】LNA/Mixer/TIA 模拟峰值过载（可能是带外干扰）。\n【ADC Peak】ADC 输出 +4/−4 样本过多 → 过载。\n【Low Power】平均功率低于门限（0～−63.5 dBFS，0.5 dB/LSB）。\n【Digital Sat】数字链饱和。\n【RSSI】接收强度；Preamble / Symbol 两套寄存器，含当前增益。\n  测点在 HB1 输出与 FIR 输入之间。\n【Full 增益表】一个指针扫 LNA/Mixer/TIA/LPF/数字。\n【Split 增益表】LMT 与 LPF 指针分开，强干扰时只降过载区。\n【增益路径】外部LNA → 内部LNA → Mixer Gm → TIA → LPF(0–24 dB) → 数字。",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "【LMT Peak】LNA/Mixer/TIA 模拟峰值过载（可能是带外干扰）。\n【ADC Peak】ADC 输出 +4/−4 样本过多 → 过载。\n【Low Power】平均功率低于门限（0～−63.5 dBFS，0.5 dB/LSB）。\n【Digital Sat】数字链饱和。\n【RSSI】接收强度；Preamble / Symbol 两套寄存器，含当前增益。\n  测点在 HB1 输出与 FIR 输入之间。\n【Full 增益表】一个指针扫 LNA/Mixer/TIA/LPF/数字。\n【Split 增益表】LMT 与 LPF 指针分开，强干扰时只降过载区。\n【增益路径】外部LNA → 内部LNA → Mixer Gm → TIA → LPF(0–24 dB) → 数字。",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "baseline": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "el0167",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 860.0,
      "y": 708.4,
      "width": 520.0,
      "height": 259.35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
