    },
    {
      "id": "el0175",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 872.0,
      "y": 1428.2,
      "width": 496.0,
      "height": 81.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1465375875,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 456535399,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. BBBW ≠ 复带宽：BBBW ≈ 复带宽 / 2。\n2. 1.4 / 1.6 / 2.5 / 5 ×BBBW：都是滤波器角点相对基带带宽的经验倍数。\n3. 抽取/内插顺序：Rx 先滤波后抽取；Tx 先内插后滤波。\n4. 模拟增益改动态范围；数字增益只缩放，不改 SNR。\n5. HB3 的 ÷3 与 INT3 的 ×3 必须同时设置，否则时钟对不齐。",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. BBBW ≠ 复带宽：BBBW ≈ 复带宽 / 2。\n2. 1.4 / 1.6 / 2.5 / 5 ×BBBW：都是滤波器角点相对基带带宽的经验倍数。\n3. 抽取/内插顺序：Rx 先滤波后抽取；Tx 先内插后滤波。\n4. 模拟增益改动态范围；数字增益只缩放，不改 SNR。\n5. HB3 的 ÷3 与 INT3 的 ×3 必须同时设置，否则时钟对不齐。",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "baseline": 12
    }
  ],
